=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: a skip mark bound to a name and never applied disables nothing
origin: #260 M1: `skip_slow = pytest.mark.skip(...)` was read as a module-level skip call and blocked
origin2: the module at high; pytest runs the test (1 passed).
=== before: tests/test_calc.py ===
import sys

import pytest


def test_add():
    assert 1 + 1 == 2
=== after: tests/test_calc.py ===
import sys

import pytest

skip_slow = pytest.mark.skip(reason="slow")


def test_add():
    assert 1 + 1 == 2
